{"slug":"sh-k-r","ar":"ش ك ر","total":75,"core":"gratitude; thanks","forms":[{"ar":"شَكَرَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":46,"gloss":"to be grateful, give thanks","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":152,"p":3,"ar":["فَٱذْكُرُونِىٓ","أَذْكُرْكُمْ","وَٱشْكُرُوا۟","لِى","وَلَا","تَكْفُرُونِ"],"en":"So remember Me; I will remember you. And be grateful to Me and do not deny Me"}},{"ar":"شَاكِر","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":14,"gloss":"Grateful, Thankful","word":"19","ex":{"s":39,"a":66,"p":6,"ar":["بَلِ","ٱللَّهَ","فَٱعْبُدْ","وَكُن","مِّنَ","ٱلشَّـٰكِرِينَ"],"en":"Rather, worship [only] Allah and be among the grateful"}},{"ar":"شَكُور","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":10,"gloss":"The Appreciative","word":"ash-shakoor","ex":{"s":35,"a":30,"p":8,"ar":["لِيُوَفِّيَهُمْ","أُجُورَهُمْ","وَيَزِيدَهُم","مِّن","فَضْلِهِۦٓ ۚ","إِنَّهُۥ","غَفُورٌ","شَكُورٌ"],"en":"That He may give them in full their rewards and increase for them of His bounty. Indeed, He is Forgiving and Appreciative"}},{"ar":"شُكُور","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"thanks, gratitude","word":null,"ex":{"s":76,"a":9,"p":10,"ar":["إِنَّمَا","نُطْعِمُكُمْ","لِوَجْهِ","ٱللَّهِ","لَا","نُرِيدُ","مِنكُمْ","جَزَآءً","وَلَا","شُكُورًا"],"en":"[Saying], \"We feed you only for the countenance of Allah. We wish not from you reward or gratitude"}},{"ar":"مَّشْكُور","kind":"passive participle","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"appreciated","word":null,"ex":{"s":76,"a":22,"p":8,"ar":["إِنَّ","هَـٰذَا","كَانَ","لَكُمْ","جَزَآءً","وَكَانَ","سَعْيُكُم","مَّشْكُورًا"],"en":"[And it will be said], \"Indeed, this is for you a reward, and your effort has been appreciated"}},{"ar":"شُكْر","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"Gratitude, thankfulness","word":"57","ex":{"s":34,"a":13,"p":15,"ar":["يَعْمَلُونَ","لَهُۥ","مَا","يَشَآءُ","مِن","مَّحَـٰرِيبَ","وَتَمَـٰثِيلَ","وَجِفَانٍ","كَٱلْجَوَابِ","وَقُدُورٍ","رَّاسِيَـٰتٍ ۚ","ٱعْمَلُوٓا۟","ءَالَ","دَاوُۥدَ","شُكْرًا ۚ","وَقَلِيلٌ","مِّنْ","عِبَادِىَ"